# Notes:
# - asset/dist/ IS tracked. The compiled Svelte bundle ships in the repo
#   so production deployments don't need a Node toolchain — composer
#   install + module activation is enough. CI rebuilds it on every PR
#   to ensure it stays in sync with src/svelte/.
